'' RUN: a call through the procedure pointer a call returned is typed as THAT pointer's result,
'' not the outer callee's (Check's N_CALL case, ProcValueCall_ in symbols/checkbase.tiko).
'' Output identical to fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/procptr-result-call.bas -o tests/codegen/procptrresultcall.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=build/obj/rtlib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-NOT: TKO0968
'' EXPECT-FILE: tests/codegen/procptrresultcall.exe
'' RUN: tests/codegen/procptrresultcall.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  7 6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: -6
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT:  12
